  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSOLIDATING DEMOCRATIC DIVIDENDS FOR SUSTAINABLE TRANSFORMATION IN KENYA PROJECT COMMONLY REFERRED TO AS THE DEEPENING DEMOCRACY PROJECT.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland contributes to  UNDP&#x2019;s multi-donor Basket Fund, which aims to strengthen electoral management institutions, systems and processes to support transparent, credible and peaceful electoral processes. In 2023, the project will focus on the lessons learned from the 2022 elections linked to youth engagement in conflict-prone counties in Kenya.</narrative>
